[[244,244]],"path":"apps/crq-python/state_fixture_provenance.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Check the kind type before set membership."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"003c2c47b751fffbaedbbfd2e76064c1a2f12ac8","body":"**Check every fixture value against the observed types.**\n\nAt `apps/crq-python/test_state_provenance.py:80`, `any(...)` accepts incompatible fixture values when one value matches. For example, a `\"str\"` specification accepts two item values `\"sample\"` and `7`. The event and work assertions have the same gap.\n\nUse `all(...)` after the existing nonempty assertion. Union specifications will still accept legitimate mixed types.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 102-102, 111-111","id":"172cd19c71d2e657f2aa7594cedc2978d6fa90fc84abc48ec3d8274ebb41279b","intervals":[[80,80]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_state_provenance.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Check every fixture value against the observed types."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"08a772191a3810b3b011659fb024c17623183585","body":"**Let non-string states reach the fallback.**\n\nAt `apps/crq-python/state_fixture_provenance.py:258`, `{\"items\":[{\"kind\":\"open\",\"state\":{}}]}` raises `TypeError` before reaching the `\"other\"` fallback. Require a string before testing `ITEM_STATES`. Preserve known states and continue to omit `None`.","id":"e50d3edc2442cdb773ca7009496d5583bbe2c351b380dc66d01e50b2d36a82ce","intervals":[[258,258]],"path":"apps/crq-python/state_fixture_provenance.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Let non-string states reach the fallback."}],"head":"c7e7bd0cfedf254d33770164eb2dfae99477b8d2","head_tree":"d16e28012af19cbe4667ce22a44fed8d3e652014","input_scope":[{"blob":"08a772191a3810b3b011659fb024c17623183585","intervals":[[1,386]],"path":"apps/crq-python/state_fixture_provenance.py"},{"blob":"9eb9d37c41dfc639511c8a97ed33e423632848e7","intervals":[[1,232]],"path":"ap